  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三十二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_cher_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里......倒下的都是些整合运动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这个，伤口流出的血液冻成了冰渣，其他部分却很完好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实是霜叶的技巧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——那边的废墟，应该是爆炸导致的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应该是陨星炸出来的没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（霜叶......杰西卡......陨星......她们，一定还......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "阿米娅，各救援小队都已抵达罗德岛、"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "我们救出了除了陨星她们以外的所有侦查小队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "没有干员在任务中牺牲。但相应的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "所有人都有不同程度的冻伤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "isRemote": true,
      "text": "你要重视这点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......冻伤？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所有侦查小队都指出，分城中徘徊着一些特殊的整合运动成员。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们有着特殊的作战方式，完全不像一般的整合运动成员那样盲目。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多加小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我......我明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，你也明白吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "明白",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也要去做一些事情了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，就算Dr.{@nickname}很有用，也别太过依靠一个人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有，注意戒指。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "其实凯尔希医生也很担心你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知不觉中——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "危险的野兽露出他们的利爪了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "整合运动在我们的背后。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "我们的退路......被切断了。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "这些感染者暴徒，似乎对我们有些想法呢。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......他们非常想要阻止我们撤退呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而，我们来到这里的目的，从来都不是逃跑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛，冲破他们的防线。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我们把陨星她们救回来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "红，听得见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊，对。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没错。在贫民区东入口处会合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。就我们两个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没问题的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对付整合运动，我们两个已经足够了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
